N:solid-glass
D:Apply deeplethe/solid-glass glass design system stylesheet and 13 AI components for shadcn/ui (React 19, Tailwind CSS 4, Base UI). Covers solid-glass.css import ordering, :root/.dark cleanup, glass-panel/glass-chosen/glass-held/glass-control classes, data-glass="opaque", --brand customization, and AI UI primitives (status-glyph, composer, tool-steps, diff-view, ask-card, context-ring, reasoning). Route zero-Tailwind agent cards to affectui, OpenUI Lang to open-intelligent-ui, and skill linting to skill-standardization.
G:solid-glass design-system shadcn tailwind-v4 base-ui glassmorphism ai-ui css-tokens
U[5]:
  Check React 19, Tailwind CSS 4, Base UI, and CSS import order via scripts/preflight.py
  Install solid-glass.css and 12 AI-native components via shadcn registry
  Remove duplicate :root and .dark color variables generated by shadcn init
  Style surfaces with bg-card, bg-popover, glass-panel, and glass-* state classes without double borders
  Customize --brand tokens and data-glass="opaque" accessibility fallbacks
S[5]{n,action,details}:
  1,Preflight,Run scripts/preflight.py --workspace <dir> --json to audit Tailwind 4 and CSS variables
  2,Install,Run npx shadcn@latest add deeplethe/solid-glass/solid-glass and needed AI components
  3,Import,Place @import "./solid-glass.css" after Tailwind and shadcn CSS and delete init :root/.dark blocks
  4,Compose,Use glass-panel, glass-chosen, glass-held, and Button variant="glass" without extra borders
  5,Tune,Override --brand and --radius or set data-glass="opaque" where blur impacts readability
R[4]:
  Never leave duplicate :root/.dark color tokens from shadcn init alongside solid-glass.css
  Never add extra Tailwind border classes onto glass-panel or bg-card/bg-popover (causes double rings)
  Import solid-glass.css after Tailwind, tw-animate-css, and shadcn/tailwind.css
  Route zero-Tailwind standalone agent React components to affectui and OpenUI Lang to open-intelligent-ui
